SY_TALK("8xA8OME3Ezo",[[2114,["Today again I must thank [SOUNDS LIKE Mr.","Swanowaphala] for singing such a beautiful"]],[2126,["song about the Devi. I was very much impressed","the way Patrick told you that they are confident"]],[2139,["that they can solve any problem. That's what","it has to be. That's the sign of a Sahaja"]],[2155,["Yogi who has reached a very great height in","his understanding about himself and about"]],[2161,["others."]],[2165,["The Chakra of the Goddess lies behind the","sternum bone in the spinal chord. This Chakra"]],[2188,["is placed above the Bhavasagara, above the","Void, as we call it in Sahaja Yoga. And the"]],[2198,["bridge that has to be crossed by the bhaktas,","by the seekers, is guarded by. She's the one,"]],[2221,["She helps Her children to come through that","passage when there are negative forces trying"]],[2235,["to attack on a seeker."]],[2242,["This chakra is placed at the back of the sternum","bone as I told you. In childhood, the antibodies"]],[2252,["are formed in the sternum bone. They are the","warriors or the [SOUNDS LIKE Sainikas] of"]],[2271,["the Devi. Until the age of 12 years they grow","and multiply, and ultimately they all get"]],[2282,["distributed all over the body, and a human","being is made able to face any outside invasion"]],[2295,["on him. These antibodies know how to fight.","They are extremely confident and they know"]],[2319,["who are their enemies. They've all these messages","built in themselves. So when the anti-God"]],[2333,["element enters into the being through any","process, say, through food, through words,"]],[2343,["through action, through devilish people, or","black magic, these antibodies combine together,"]],[2359,["collectively fight the invaders."]],[2366,["Those who do not have their Central Heart","properly developed suffer from tremendous"]],[2380,["insecurity all their lives. When they are","children, you try to control them by frightening."]],[2399,["These children later on become extremely insecure.","They are afraid of darkness, they are afraid"]],[2410,["of night. Some of them are afraid of everything.","Because the antibodies that are built in the"]],[2422,["body are not sufficient in number and being","this center so weak, the person feels extremely"]],[2434,["insecure. Later on in life when the child","goes to the school or he tries to work out"]],[2447,["something for the future, then also his confidence","can be shaken by parents, teachers, and outside"]],[2464,["people. So it is very important to understand","children who are growing."]],[2471,["In the West they analyze everything and try","to put human beings into compartments. First"]],[2483,["the child, is a child according to them, child","has no innocence, and he's extremely selfish."]],[2495,["Second part is adolescence, which they think","is","a very arbitrary, moody stuff. In India, we"]],[2512,["do not know that there is something like adolescence.","Now these adolescent people form a group,"]],[2520,["and they start criticizing or making fun of","all the elders. At a very young age it starts."]],[2531,["First they make fun of the teachers, then","of the parents, then of all the people who"]],[2538,["are senior to them. They start becoming extremely","active in their brains because they see too"]],[2549,["many televisions and things like that, and","then they start behaving at a very young age"]],[2559,["in such violent ways that one cannot imagine."]],[2564,["I used to live about 25 miles away from London.","And every time I would go to London, I would"]],[2574,["find some children doing some sort of a mischief,","somewhere. One day some of them entered into"]],[2580,["my compartment, and they started pulling out","all the covers, thrusting their knives into"]],[2592,["the seats, opening out all the upholstery.","I was just sitting and watching. So I said,"]],[2604,["\"Now are you tired? Please sit down. What's","the problem?\" They said, \"We are all very"]],[2611,["angry.\" I said, \"For what? Why are you angry?\"","Said, \"We are just angry.\" I said, \"But you"]],[2617,["have to be angry for something.\" They were","children going to good schools definitely,"]],[2629,["wearing very good clothes. And then I had","to, - when the train stopped - I called the"]],[2636,["ticket collector and told him that these boys","have been doing all this hooliganic, hooliganism"]],[2639,["in the compartment and you better look at","it. And he came in and he said, \"this is a"]],[2650,["common thing\" and then somehow or other he","took them out."]],[2655,["But the only thing I felt about them is, that","all of them had their Center Heart catching."]],[2664,["On the Kundalini, they were catching their","Center Heart. But when they saw Me, they sat"]],[2672,["down. They were quiet, they listened to Me.","I settled their Center Heart. And most of"]],[2685,["them said, \"We are angry with our mother.\"","\"Why?\" \"Because our brothers are angry.\" \"But"]],[2691,["why your brothers are angry?\" Then I discovered","that Freud has given these funny ideas against"]],[2699,["the mother. Mother itself, can you imagine!","What a anti-God activity it is."]],[2706,["To an Indian, Mother is the primal thing - any","Indian. Because his sense of security lies"]],[2719,["in the mother. Even if the father is hot-tempered,","is angry, still they depend on the mother."]],[2733,["Because mother knows when to get angry and","when not to get angry. She has the discrimination."]],[2740,["And she is the one who protects them."]],[2746,["The idea of Mother is completely blasted in","the West, and this is the reason why the children"]],[2755,["of that country feel so insecure, and when","they grow, they are extremely insecure. You"]],[2763,["won't believe that all the time they are polishing","their brass, cleaning their house, but not"]],[2772,["even a rat enters their houses. And if they","have to talk to someone, they'll make a person"]],[2779,["stand outside and talk from inside, specially","in London, because they are literally frightened."]],[2784,["Nobody will believe, the British who ruled","us, are such frightened people. But they are."]],[2792,["They are frightened of each other, they are","frightened of themselves. The reason is, the"]],[2798,["Center Heart is absolutely weak."]],[2802,["I've told you the first reason, the family","insecurities. The child does not know when"]],[2810,["he comes back from school, whether his mother","would be there or she would be gone. They"]],[2819,["don't have mothers who can bear a lot from","the husbands and smile and show no signs of"]],[2828,["their agony to their children. But the mothers","in that country, I've seen, always try to"]],[2834,["use their children from all kinds of emotional","blackmail, you can call it. They try to torture"]],[2842,["the child by telling all the things the husband","is doing to them and whatever is the problem"]],[2848,["they are facing with the husbands. So the","child is not secured by the mother, but, on"]],[2855,["the contrary, child starts giving security","to mother there. At a very young age it starts,"]],[2863,["and the child becomes extremely negative and","left-sided. He feels that he's born in a place"]],[2872,["full of hatred, insecurity, and fear."]],[2876,["When the bhaktas are born in those countries,","they are also the same way. Because they think"]],[2884,["if they have to go to a Guru, the Guru, as","known so far, tortures them or extracts all"]],[2892,["the money, takes their [SOUNDS LIKE pareeksha,","tess], and he sometimes leaves them high and"]],[2899,["dry on the streets."]],[2904,["But in our country the Goddess has taken Incarnation","many a times. Thousands time She has taken"]],[2913,["here Her birth, whenever the bhaktas called","Her, when they are pestered by the negative"]],[2922,["force, She came on this Earth to save them.","These things used to be just accepted by people,"]],[2935,["but never were really accepted in their hearts.","People thought these are some sorts of mythological"]],[2947,["stories that the Goddess came on this Earth","and She tried to save the people. They could"]],[2954,["not believe that there could be a Shakti who","could be born, who could fight these horrible"]],[2961,["rakshasas, and kill them, and save Her children,","Her bhaktas, from agony. It was too much."]],[2971,["But today in Sahaja Yoga, you have seen that","when Kundalini rises and stops at the Center"]],[2980,["Nabhi, you have to say the mantra of 'Jagadamba',","and the Kundalini rises. That means, She resides"]],[2992,["in the Center Heart, and when She is being","worshipped, the Kundalini rises. This center"]],[3008,["has got twelve petals. But the Goddess has","thousand hands and thousand eyes. She has"]],[3029,["16,000 Naris to work out Her different aspects","of enlightenment. But the first thing She"]],[3043,["has to do, through Her generosity, and kindness,","and compassion, and patience, She has to suck"]],[3053,["in the sins - the [SOUNDS LIKE Papavimochini]","- the sins of human beings."]],[3063,["One of the sentences in Bible was, \"Wages","of fear is sin.\" Or you can put it the other"]],[3074,["way round, \"The wages of sin is fear.\" If","you have fear, you are committing a sin against"]],[3089,["your Self and against God. Because, if Mother","is Almighty, and She can solve all your problems,"]],[3102,["you are under Her protection, then why should","you have any fear? That means you do not believe"]],[3107,["that She's that powerful. When a person is","frightened, this center start breathing fast,"]],[3121,["giving rhythmic instructions to all the antibodies.","With that you feel you are getting a palpitation"]],[3137,["in the heart. This palpitation is nothing","but a signal to all the antibodies to fight"]],[3148,["the emergency of an attack."]],[3153,["But when somebody builds up insecurity later","on in life, it becomes a physical problem."]],[3169,["If they have insecurities earlier, it is an","emotional problem. But later on in life, when"]],[3177,["one develops a insecurity - any kind, like","a wife is insecure about her husband; husband"]],[3186,["is a loafer or a bad man, and carrying on","with other women, so the motherhood of the"]],[3197,["wife is challenged. And when her motherhood","is challenged, she may get the weakening of"]],[3205,["this center, by which she may suffer quite","a lot and may have even breast cancer. These"]],[3213,["insecurities can be also self-made, imaginary.","People can just think about it and build up"]],[3220,["some sort of insecurities, which are of no","actual existence."]],[3230,["But such fears are very much more in the West.","Because the life in the West has no mooring,"]],[3242,["has no explanation. Whatever you ask them,","they'll say, \"What's wrong?\" A husband will"]],[3246,["say, \"What's wrong?\" in having a keep. And","the wife will also say, \"All right, if he"]],[3253,["wants to have a keep, let him have it.\" In","India, no woman would tolerate such a situation."]],[3258,["She would starve, she would do everything,","but she will never touch a man who has a keep."]],[3269,["So the basis of the strength of Indian women","is their sense of chastity. The sense of chastity"]],[3282,["in the Indian women is so great that nothing","can deter them as long as they are chaste."]],[3292,["But if they are not chaste, then fear settles","in them very fast. Chastity is the strength"]],[3305,["of women. And that's why those women who have","fear, mostly, have a problem of their chastity"]],[3314,["being challenged. A woman who is frightened","that her chastity may be disturbed, also can"]],[3325,["develop a problem with the Heart Chakra. Such","women can develop breast cancers, breathing"]],[3342,["troubles, and other kind of frightening diseases","on the emotional level also."]],[3351,["This Chakra is ruined in women when they lose","their only child; because their motherhood"]],[3363,["is finished, they feel. And that is the worst","thing that can happen to a woman, if she's"]],[3370,["a woman. But if she's not a woman, she doesn't","feel much, and she just behaves in a very"]],[3379,["manly way. And that's what I've seen in the","West, that women really don't much care when"]],[3387,["their children die. But it is because they","are not women. If you are a woman you definitely"]],[3396,["feel for your children and their death. But","after some time, such a woman comes back again"]],[3405,["and she accepts the life as it is, for the","sake of her husband, or may be if she has"]],[3412,["more relations or other children. She becomes","extremely powerful as a reaction to what has"]],[3420,["happened to her."]],[3424,["That's only possible if your center of Heart","is all right. Such women do not grudge, do"]],[3434,["not complain, are extremely serene, and can","bear up lots of things. They are extremely"]],[3441,["tolerant and can go to any extent to help","their children, but they are never spoiling"]],[3451,["their children. They never spoil their children,","because they understand spoiling is much worse"]],[3457,["than beating the child. They never spoil the","children, nor ever pamper them, and never"]],[3464,["get dominated by their children. They know,","\"I have to guide the child and have to look"]],[3471,["after the child.\" So they look after all the","ideals and righteousness and the virtues of"]],[3477,["the child. And if he tries to get out of it,","they go all out to win him over back to virtue"]],[3487,["and to better life. But those people, those","women, who do not care for actual growth of"]],[3498,["the child, may just avoid it and escape it."]],[3502,["In the men, this chakra is caught up if they","have lost their mother very early, or if their"]],[3511,["mother by chance is a very cruel woman. Also","this chakra can be caught up by men, if they"]],[3521,["have been to wars, and if they have seen frightful","things in the war. Such people could be extremely"]],[3530,["emotional and could be easily befooled by","people who try to win over their emotions."]],[3545,["What is to be done to improve this chakra?","In Sahaja Yoga we have many techniques by"]],[3552,["which we can improve this chakra, and get","your confidence back. As Patrick has said"]],[3559,["- that he never used to speak. And I have","seen many actors who act very well and when"]],[3568,["they came to My program, they said, \"Mother","please don't ask us to speak because we just"]],[3573,["don't know how to speak. We can act, but we","cannot speak to people.\" They tried once or"]],[3578,["twice and they ended up with two-three sentences,","mumbled down and sat down. I found out all"]],[3587,["of them had this Chakra very badly damaged.","Perhaps they lacked the love of their mothers,"]],[3597,["perhaps they did not love their mothers, or","perhaps, may be that they did not understand"]],[3604,["the value of virginity in women."]],[3608,["So those men, who try to look at every woman","who passes by, those men who try to have lusty"]],[3621,["eyes, can also develop this center very badly.","And lots of problems can come through this"]],[3631,["center."]],[3632,["One of the problems that comes through this","could be lung cancer. But I've seen this center"]],[3642,["is very badly affected also by certain negligence","in life. Like some people have a habit of"]],[3649,["having a very hot bath, and then coming out","of that hot bath and enter into some cool"]],[3657,["place. Such people will catch this center","very badly and they will have a problem. Then"]],[3665,["there's another thing, which is looks very","simple, but many people have a habit in, specially"]],[3671,["summers, to wear a one single kurta or a single","shirt and not the under-shirt. This is also"]],[3683,["not proper. A man must always have something","under his shirt, otherwise when it starts"]],[3692,["perspiring, he can get trouble into this Heart","Center."]],[3698,["This Heart Center is caught up by various","emotional problems in human beings. Husband"]],[3704,["and wife, if they all the time quarrel, there's","always quarrelling in the house, specially"]],[3711,["if the mother is very dominating, the child","develops this center. And if the father is"]],[3717,["very dominating, the child develops this - the","Heart itself. So it is very important that"]],[3724,["husband and wife should never quarrel in the","presence of their children."]],[3731,["Now there resides in this center, the incarnation","of the Goddess, who came on this Earth thousands"]],[3740,["of time, and She resides there for your protection.","But first of all you have to be worthy of"]],[3750,["Her protection. When She came on this Earth","many a times, you know, Her body was made"]],[3758,["by various forces, as if She was like a bubble","and the bubble was covered by so many things"]],[3765,["added on to that. And that's how She got lots","of things from various Gods. Like Her hair"]],[3775,["She got from Yama, the God of death; Her nose","She got from ah the God of wealth, Kubera;"]],[3790,["and Her ear She got from the Povana, that","is air. Like that, Her body was made specially"]],[3798,["by the essences of these great Deities, who","donated their essences to the Goddess, to"]],[3807,["be equipped to do these multifarious activities."]],[3811,["Now the first activity, as I told you, of","the Goddess is to save Her children from the"]],[3818,["negative forces. So She looks extremely mild,","sweet but She can be extremely violent, - in"]],[3828,["the sense, She can kill or crush anyone who","tries to overpower Her children. [SOUNDS LIKE"]],[3838,["Atisaumya Atiraudra] - these two temperaments","exist only in the Goddess, because She is"]],[3848,["the Mother; and at any cost She wants to save","Her child. Also towards Her child when he"]],[3856,["goes beyond a point of understanding, when","he shows no sense of discipline, then also"]],[3862,["Goddess can pull him down by certain methods","that She adopts."]],[3868,["Now first of all is that She gives all that","is needed to remove the fear from the mind"]],[3876,["of sadhakas. Secondly, She cures this center","by giving birth to additional antibodies in"]],[3889,["the body. And, by vibrating the tired antibodies","to act in a way that they can fight back again."]],[3909,["Even in day-to-day life, She may establish","Her existence by showing lots of miracles"]],[3916,["to Her children. We had a lady coming to see","Me and she was rather late. And when she came"]],[3926,["back I asked her what was the problem, she","said, \"No, there was no problem, but my bus"]],[3932,["fell down about 20-30 feet down, and the thing","rolled down and fell on the ground with all"]],[3944,["the four legs intact. And all of us in the","bus were saved. But the driver got upset and"]],[3952,["he ran away. So somebody who was ah in the","car, who knew how to drive, came down and"]],[3960,["he start - switched on the car and the car","started moving. And we came back then to Bombay.\""]],[3968,["So, on the way they started asking, \"There","must be some saint sitting here, otherwise"]],[3973,["how can we be protected? Only a saint can","protect us like this.\" And she was wearing"]],[3978,["my ring. \"Oh!\" - they said - \"This is Mataji's","disciple.\" They all started falling at her"]],[3984,["feet, saying, \"Oh! You have saved us, you","have saved us.\""]],[3988,["So, there are many miracles that take place","in your life. When you see an accident taking"]],[3992,["place, suddenly you find the accident is over.","There was one fellow, was a journalist called"]],[3998,["Marathe. He and his friend, another journalist,","were coming from Lonavla down, and it's a"]],[4006,["very big sloppy road, ghat, and their brakes","failed. And the driver said, \"Now the brakes"]],[4013,["have failed and you take God's name.\" And","they started remembering their Mother. And"]],[4021,["suddenly they saw a big truck coming ahead.","They were about to bang onto that, they closed"]],[4028,["their eyes. And God knows what happened - they","opened the eyes and saw the truck was going"]],[4035,["upward and they were moving forward without","any difficulties. And they were amazed how"]],[4040,["it has happened, as if somebody has lifted","their car and put before the truck, and they"]],[4045,["been saved. And the driver also closed his","eyes and took the name of the Mother. It is"]],[4049,["possible! It has happened with so many people","that they do not know how it works out."]],[4058,["So one has to believe that we have the Mother","within ourselves, in our heart, and if She's"]],[4063,["awakened, She is going to look after us. She","is going to give all the protection that is"]],[4071,["needed. And there's nothing to be frightened","of anything."]],[4074,["But you can imagine, as Patrick has said clearly,","that they were quite frightened, and I know"]],[4080,["they are. Even English language is like that.","All the time they'll say, \"I am afraid...\""]],[4085,["\"I am afraid I have to go.\" What is there","to be afraid, if you have to go? You better"]],[4091,["go. \"I am afraid, if I am doing.\" - they are","all the time jittery like that. And so jittery"]],[4097,["and when they talk, you know, they are so","frightened that sometimes you feel nervous"]],[4100,["with them, that you you do not know how to","approach them, the way they are nervous. And"]],[4105,["one of the reasons why they are nervous is","that, because they plan too much, think too"]],[4110,["much, analyze too much and then ego settles","down into their brains, and ultimately covers"]],[4118,["the heart. Because their ego covers their","heart, they get a fright. Actually it so happens"]],[4124,["that if you become ego-oriented you start","seeing yourself through. Because when you"]],[4133,["are at a level, you can even see your ego","very clearly, and then you get frightened"]],[4139,["of other people, because you think they too","also must be having the same type of an ego,"]],[4144,["and you are really frightened of it."]],[4148,["It is very common also, in the East. Now in","India, I should say, that supposing you have"]],[4151,["to go to a government office, be careful.","Ah, anybody, even a [SOUNDS LIKE chaprasi]"]],[4160,["can shout at you for nothing at all. They","develop a system of barking all the time,"]],[4168,["just go on barking. The reason is they bark","at you because they themselves are insecure."]],[4173,["A chaprasi is insecure of his boss, his boss","is insecure of his boss, his boss is insecure"]],[4178,["of his boss, ultimately the minister is afraid","of the voters, and the voters are afraid of"]],[4183,["the minister. It's such a vicious circle.","So the whole system works out into such a"]],[4188,["terrible insecurity (Shri Mataji laughing)","that you don't understand what is there to"]],[4193,["bark at? What is there to shout at? And then","a kind of a identification with the falsehood"]],[4204,["is built up so much that you are no more a","human being; you are either a secretary or"]],[4206,["you are an under secretary or a joint secretary,","I do not know who is higher who is lower."]],[4210,["And then you have a some other secretaries","and then you have clerks, and this, and that,"]],[4218,["and that. And you are that, you are nothing","else but that. So because you are that, you"]],[4227,["must have these horns, and you must shout","at people, otherwise nobody is going to believe"]],[4231,["that you are something."]],[4233,["So it is such an identification that develops","into human beings, that too, because of this"]],[4238,["Heart not being developed properly. Because","if your Heart is developed properly, then"]],[4245,["you are a human being. Because you know your","Mother has given you the birth and you are"]],[4249,["a human being. It is there's no need to have","any fear from another human being who is also"]],[4256,["a child of your Mother. So there has to be","no fear about it."]],[4261,["But the trouble is that when human beings","ah start wearing anything; supposing they"]],[4267,["wear a suit, immediately they'll start speaking","in English. As soon as they wear pajamas,"]],[4273,["they start speaking in Hindi language, or,","say, dhoti, - Hindi language and pajamas,"]],[4280,["they might start giving [SOUNDS LIKE galis].","So it is a kind of a very superficial identification"]],[4289,["human beings develop, because there is no","depth in the heart. If they had that depth,"]],[4295,["that mooring in the heart, then they would","not develop these superficial things. And"]],[4299,["as a result of that, they are frightened.","Because they know they are superficial, others"]],[4304,["are superficial, they have got beard, we have","got beard. So they'll quarrel, if I am going"]],[4309,["to pull his beard, he might pull my beard","as well. Such a fear exist among human beings."]],[4316,["And then, another thing, another steps come","into the minds of the people, that, why not"]],[4322,["pull his legs to go up? This is the third","category of debasement."]],[4330,["If you are the child of the same Mother, how","can you go higher than anybody else? You will"]],[4339,["remain always the child of the Mother. How","can you go higher than any other child, in"]],[4345,["the eyes of Mother? You cannot. On the contrary,","if you try to do such tricks, the Mother will"]],[4352,["punish you."]],[4354,["And this is the second thing that Mother does,","is to punish Her children. Yes, She punishes."]],[4361,["In very sweet ways first of all. For example,","if the child is not eating and troubling,"]],[4368,["She said, \"All right, you don't want to eat,","all right, don't eat.\" That's a very simple"]],[4376,["way of punishing children. But then She says,","\"All right you want to have the way you want"]],[4382,["to have, go ahead.\""]],[4384,["Like I tell them not to do such and such thing,","it's not good. For example, I told them that"]],[4389,["don't ah change the flats just from the beginning,","and let the all the Sahaja Yogis stay with"]],[4398,["other Sahaja Yogis. But the organizers thought,","it's better to take the flats, whatever may"]],[4404,["be the reason. Because (Smiling) they are","very wise organizers. But, you see, Mother"]],[4408,["says something very simple, but it has a meaning,","one must know. And they arranged it that way."]],[4417,["So, half of the people just protested that,","\"No, we are going to see stay with some Sahaja"]],[4423,["Yogis, we want to be with them.\" So they were","accommodating. The others were, - British,"]],[4426,["- you know, now a days are on the other side","of the mood. They are very, very tolerant."]],[4435,["And they said, \"All right, if we are not arranged,","we'll stay in the flats.\" So they stayed in"]],[4442,["the flats. But what happened? It rained, and","rained, and rained, and rained, and they could"]],[4447,["not arrange their food even under the ah roof","they had built. So they had to shift, all"]],[4454,["of them, to other places, and all of them","had to stay with other Sahaja Yogis, as told"]],[4459,["by Mother. If they had listened to the Mother,","they would have saved some money, as well"]],[4465,["as they would have saved some trouble, and","there would have been no problem at all. That's"]],[4471,["how little tricks here and there are played","by Mother just to convince the children that"]],[4476,["you have been stupid."]],[4479,["Now, there are so many things like that which","Mother can play, and Her playfulness is very"]],[4490,["important in life. Because if She is severe","with the children, they'll run away. If She's"]],[4499,["like any other gurus, the Gurus, the Satgurus","also, they used to beat their disciples! They"]],[4505,["used to hang them by a string! You don't know","how the Gurus treat their disciples! Some"]],[4513,["of them take lots of money from their disciples,","and some of them take lots of aa things from"]],[4519,["their disciple. They want complete surrendering,","and they make them subservient. They really"]],[4525,["torture the lives of their children, of their","disciples, we should say! But the Mother doesn't"]],[4533,["want to do that. So she plays little tricks","here and there and tries to correct the children."]],[4539,["Now I'll give you an example of a Guru, whom","I met about five-six years back. He came from"]],[4549,["Amarnath to a small village, small district","place near Bombay, where a Sahaja Yogini was"]],[4556,["staying. And he sent his disciple, who was","staying in that place, to see that Sahaja"]],[4561,["Yogini. And she he went in and told that,","\"You see, my Guru is coming, and he wants"]],[4566,["to see Mataji. And he has told me that only","Adi Shakti will clear out my Agnya chakra.\""]],[4573,["So she couldn't understand, she said, \"What","is your Guru doing?\" \"Oh, God! Don't talk"]],[4577,["about him,\" he held his ears. \"Don't take","his name. Oh! You can't know how - what sort"]],[4583,["of a person he is.\" he said. \"But why doesn't","he open your Agnya Chakra? Mother will be"]],[4589,["coming but, of course, why shouldn't you do","that?\" He said, \"No, no, no, no! He said only"]],[4593,["She should open, nobody else should open it.","And he sent me to this place about five years"]],[4599,["back, saying that in the sixth year Adi Shakti","will be coming, and She'll open your Agnya"]],[4606,["Chakra.\" Now can you believe it! Poor fellow","suffering from that horrid Agnya Chakra, was"]],[4611,["suffering when this Guru had come."]],[4614,["So he came to see Me and he told Me, \"Mother,","my Guru has come and he wants to see You.\""]],[4619,["So I went to see him. And this Guru was sitting","down there with a big temper, you see, the"]],[4625,["nose were all bloating. Of course, when I","went there he touched My feet and everything,"]],[4630,["and then he called one very bad name to this","thing, \"Did he go, did he touch Your feet?"]],[4635,["Was he all right? Was he behaving all right?\"","I said, \"He was all right, but I can't understand"]],[4639,["why did you not open his Agnya chakra!\" He","said, \"Let him go to hell now! I am not going"]],[4644,["to open his Agnya Chakra, who opened my Agnya","chakra? Why should I open his Agnya chakra?\""]],[4651,["So I said, \"This is not good. I should open.\"","\"Yes, yes, you will, because you are a Mother."]],[4657,["I am not a Mother.\" So he went inside, ah","and the disciple told Me, \"Mother! He hanged"]],[4666,["me by legs on top of this well! For three","days I was hanging there.\" I said, \"For what?"]],[4673,["Why did he hang you there?\" You said you said","she said, \"Don't ask any one.\" Then he came"]],[4679,["in, \"Yes, yes, I hanged you! Yes, I will,","again!\" So I said, \"Why did you hang him?\""]],[4684,["\"He was smoking. Because he was smoking, I","hanged him there. I said, now smoke, and I"]],[4689,["was putting him down, up and down,\" I said,","I am smoking you.\" And he tortured him like"]],[4694,["this. I said, \"But why should you do such","a horrible thing?\" He says, \"Otherwise how"]],[4699,["will you discipline? I am not a Mother. I","don't know how to discipline. This is the"]],[4702,["only way I can discipline him.\" And he said,","\"You go on spoiling him, but I am going to"]],[4707,["discipline him like that.\" \"All right, - I","said, - you shut up now, just now don't talk,"]],[4710,["or by let Me put his Agnya right.\""]],[4712,["And I took about two minutes to put his Agnya","right. I said, \"His Agnya is all right now\"."]],[4716,["Ah. Then he said, \"Did he promise You that","he will not smoke?\" I said, \"He did not.\""]],[4721,["So he said, \"You better ask him to promise,","otherwise I will not allow him to eat his"]],[4725,["food for three days.\" I said, \"Ba-ba! This","is a horrible Guru! God save this disciple"]],[4732,["from this Guru (Shri Mataji laughs)."]],[4734,["But, you see, what he was meaning that there","should be a discipline in a disciple. There"]],[4742,["has to be a complete understanding that he","is the Guru. But he said, \"Look at these people."]],[4751,["How are they? They take liberties with You,","they trouble You so much, eh they try to be"]],[4756,["funny with You. Still You don't say anything","to them.\" I said, \"I don't have to say. I"]],[4759,["know how to correct them.\" So this is the","quality of the Mother, who can correct people."]],[4767,["She knows who doubts them, She knows who thinks","aah who thinks wrong about Her. She knows"]],[4773,["who thinks rightly about Her. She knows everything.","If She knows everything, She doesn't have"]],[4778,["to worry. She is completely secure about it,","and She doesn't have the insecurity of the"]],[4783,["Guru, that one day the disciple will misbehave","or anything, because She knows how to correct."]],[4787,["The other day I met one gentleman, a Sahaja","Yogi, and he came to Me and he started explaining"]],[4794,["to Me, \"Mother, You don't know, this happened...\"","I said, \"Now, I don't know anything, isn't"]],[4800,["it? You think I don't know anything?\" He said,","\"Yes Mother, how will You know?\" I said I"]],[4803,["said, \"I'll tell you one thing, that you pay","play lot of cricket in your childhood until"]],[4806,["you came to Sahaja Yoga.\" \"Yes, that's true.","How do You know?\" I said, \"That's how I knew.\""]],[4813,["So I know on, then you know. Then he accepted,","\"All right, You know Mother all about me,"]],[4820,["I don't know how You know.\" But She's [SOUNDS","LIKE Avalokiteshvari] - She's the one who"]],[4824,["sees everything. She knows, somehow or the","other, She knows. How She knows, that cannot"]],[4828,["be explained at this stage. But She knows","each and everything what you are doing, if"]],[4832,["She wants to."]],[4834,["And the third quality of a Mother is, that","She's a Mahamaya. She talks like you, sits"]],[4841,["like you, ah She'll behave like you, ah everything","will be just like you. And you won't be able"]],[4847,["to make out the depth of this woman, who is","a Maha Maya because She plays such tricks"]],[4854,["on you and such thing in such a beautiful","way that you cannot make it out. You think"]],[4858,["that you're all right. You go to a person","and you tell anything you feel like about"]],[4867,["Mother, you try to do anything and ultimately","you discover that everything She knows. And"]],[4873,["when you discover that, gradually you start","understanding that, \"When She knows everything"]],[4878,["about me,"]],[4879,["I better be all right.\" And how does She know?","Because She resides in your Center Heart."]],[4888,["She knows everything what you have been doing,","what you are doing, what you're thinking of"]],[4893,["doing. So She what does She do? [SOUNDS LIKE","Sankalpa vikalpa karowati], whatever sankalpas"]],[4898,["you are making, She'll make it fall. If you","say, \"Now, I have decided, Mother, to do this,"]],[4903,["and I'm going to do it\" it will fail. You","have to judge yourself as a real son of your"]],[4913,["Mother."]],[4914,["As in Bombay or any place we tried to get","some land, nobody could get it. \"We tried,"]],[4919,["tried, tried, you see. This is black market","money, bribery, corruption.\" I said, \"Nothing"]],[4922,["doing, I'm not going to do any of those things.\"","So then said, \"Then Mother, how are we to"]],[4927,["achieve it?\" I said, \"You will achieve it,","don't you worry.\" Then they started saying,"]],[4931,["\"She's not practical, She's this, She's that.\"","And everybody, who said, turned out to be"]],[4936,["very impractical. \"Ultimately\", - I said,","- \"When you will be ready for Sahaja Yoga,"]],[4939,["then you'll get the land and the Ashram.\"","Because once you start an Ashram and have"]],[4946,["some money there, you'll find all kinds of","bhoots will join together and will make fun"]],[4951,["with the money that has been collected, there","won't be any proper arrangement, no proper"]],[4956,["discipline."]],[4958,["And that is why the time has to be given for","children to learn through making errors, through"]],[4966,["making mistakes, and understanding what mistakes","we are making and how we have to correct it."]],[4973,["Once they start understanding it, then it","is very easy, very easy to communicate to"]],[4978,["them what they are supposed to do, what they","have done is wrong, and how to correct it."]],[4986,["But as long as they think they are LIKE very","wise, as long as they think they are extremely"]],[4991,["nice people, and that they are on their own,","Mother says, \"All right, go ahead, doesn't"]],[4997,["matter.\""]],[4998,["Now you must know that Mother has saved people","from that Bhavasagara with such great difficulty."]],[5005,["It's not easy to do that, it's a tremendous","task. Sometimes to raise the Kundalini of"]],[5010,["thousands of people, I feel like ah a big","mountain I have to raise. It's terrible. But"]],[5020,["people on the whole, who are not yet corrected,","think they are obliging Me by taking Realization."]],[5027,["This is a very common feeling with human beings.","And I feel like laughing at the stupidity"]],[5033,["of the ego, that they are obliging Me by taking","this ooh Realization. And the way they talk"]],[5041,["is all on this terminology, \"I came, I was","sitting there for three days, I never got"]],[5047,["Realization.\" As if I've done some criminal","act."]],[5053,["So the whole attitude of a person gradually","changes towards the Mother, and he starts"]],[5058,["thinking that, \"She is here for my well being.","And my well being is Her only concern about"]],[5067,["me. Somehow She'll achieve my Realization.","She's working very hard, and I must co-operate."]],[5074,["I must learn to co-operate, it is for my [SOUNDS","LIKE heeta], for my good, She's doing it."]],[5080,["And I should try to understand that it is","for my good.\" When such an attitude is developed,"]],[5086,["it is much easier to establish a disciple."]],[5090,["But this disciple is different from a son","or a daughter. Because Mother is a Guru, no"]],[5098,["doubt, Mother is a Guru from the very beginning","you are born. But for a Mother, it is very"]],[5103,["difficult to be as harsh as these Guru are.","Not at all, nowhere near them. One cannot"]],[5109,["beat them in the harshness. But it is for","you, in your own wisdom, to understand how"]],[5116,["to behave, how to ask for Realization, how","to change your attitude. Because if you think"]],[5123,["too much of yourself, and you try to show","off, She'll say, \"Yes, yes, you are very great,"]],[5128,["really you are very, very great, you know\",","till you suddenly discover that you have developed"]],[5132,["two big horns your head and now you are good","for nothing. Then She will say, \"All right,"]],[5138,["now come along, you have developed this disease,","I'll put you right.\" So better not do all"]],[5145,["those things."]],[5145,["On one side She is willing to go all out to","save you from all troubles. Like, supposing"]],[5152,["you have some heart trouble, if you have some","any other trouble, She'll go all out to save"]],[5157,["you. It's not easy to cure anybody's heart.","People think that Mother has cured us, so"]],[5160,["it is all right, take it for granted. It's","not so. When you get Sahaja Yoga, you'll be"]],[5165,["surprised that when you try to cure one person,","you'll fall sick for three days. Is not easy"]],[5172,["to cure. And those people, who cure, sometimes","do it through bhoots, also. Those who have"]],[5179,["bhoots can also cure. Because they themselves","are bhoots, what can happen to the bhoots?"]],[5183,["They cure people but put one bhoot into the","patient in such a way that that patient becomes"]],[5189,["a slave. And such bhootish people can be curer,","or faith healers, or anything, like supraconscious,"]],[5197,["all sorts of people, but when they cure any","person, be sure they are putting another serious,"]],[5206,["more serious problem into. They do not cure","you really. They actually are putting some"]],[5212,["diseases into you, or into the patients, it's","a very risky game."]],[5217,["But a Sahaja Yogi, if he tries to cure somebody","- because he cannot put somebody else in the"]],[5223,["vacuum - he gets a problem himself. He's sucked","in. So, My advice is always for every Sahaja"]],[5236,["Yogi that you should not cure anyone. There","is no need for you to cure by touching. You"]],[5245,["should use My photograph, you can distribute","My photograph, tell people how to cure themselves."]],[5250,["But don't cure anybody because you will have","problems, because you are not a bhoot. And"]],[5257,["your will be hit hard. So be careful about","it, don't try to cure anyone, only use the"]],[5264,["photograph. By using the photograph the shraddha","will be there, the person will be steady,"]],[5272,["and you'll be all right."]],[5274,["Ah, like yesterday we had some patient here.","And some people felt the compassion, you know,"]],[5280,["for that. And they all caught up. There was","no need to feel compassion. Have you got more"]],[5284,["compassion than I have? What was the need","to bring the patient here? There was no need."]],[5290,["But they both got caught up. So there is no","need to bring any patients to Me. That's not"]],[5296,["the way to behave. Never bring any patient.","If there's a patient, leave them alone. Tell"]],[5300,["them, \"Mother will look after you. We have","nothing to say. You. There's a photograph,"]],[5306,["you must use the photograph, get your treatment","done with the photograph, and you get cured.\""]],[5312,["Otherwise, first thing that will happen to","you, that you'll catch on your Center Heart."]],[5318,["Because that's not your job. You are not to","do that. If you try to do it, actually it"]],[5324,["is your ego sometimes that makes you think","that you should cure a person, sometimes."]],[5329,["And when you try to do through your ego, you","get into trouble. Not that you cannot cure."]],[5337,["You can. But you have to be of that level,","when you try to cure a person you do not become"]],[5344,["a supraconcious personality, means you do","not become ego-oriented. But they do, ultimately,"]],[5349,["all of them. Those who have tried to cure","others, and do like that, they have gone out"]],[5354,["of Sahaja Yoga completely, becoming just mediums.","They have become mediums, horrible people."]],[5359,["When they talk on the phone, I feel somebody's","pouring poison into my ears. They are so horrid,"]],[5367,["that you can't imagine."]],[5367,["So, it is important for people who get Realization","not to indulge into any curing because they"]],[5374,["will develop this Center Heart very much."]],[5378,["Center Heart can be developed in countries","where there's all fear, people are frightened."]],[5383,["It can be developed by other things by which","people are frightened. Reading books of bad"]],[5390,["gurus and reading the books about shocking","things, like many people who read the Kundalini's"]],[5397,["book have got Center Heart (Shri Mataji laughing),","because they are so frightened about the Kundalini!"]],[5404,["Anything that frightens you if you read can","make your heart very, very weak and dangerous."]],[5410,["Now we have two other sides to this Center","Heart - is the Mother's Heart - is Her own"]],[5415,["brother, is Vishnu, takes incarnation as Shri","Rama on the Right Heart. Who, we think is"]],[5423,["the (Mother) - Father who is looking after","His children. So that is the Father, and this"]],[5430,["is the Mother. Though here the Father and","the Mother are in two aspects, that the Mother"]],[5436,["is the ah Sister of the Father. And Father","is the Mama of the disciple of the sadhakas."]],[5448,["The Mama is a greater father than a father,","as you all know. And so this Uncle who is"]],[5455,["the incarnation of Shri Narayana, looks after","the protected aah disciples of the Mother."]],[5470,["He gives that Father's understanding to the","children. Because at this stage, this Father,"]],[5480,["God Almighty, is not known, who is Shiva.","So this Uncle looks after the children till"]],[5490,["they are grown up enough to meet their Father.","And that is how we can say that Parvati, or"]],[5498,["Uma, or Devi, She comes to Her Mother's place,","[SOUNDS LIKE Mayka], and resides in this Center"]],[5506,["Heart. And there Her brother protects Her","children. When She gives Realization to children,"]],[5513,["or gives them second birth, then this Mama","looks after the Sister's children and helps"]],[5522,["them to build up the security of a father."]],[5528,["So the right side of every human being represents","the fatherhood, the Fatherhood. And the Fatherhood"]],[5539,["of a man is very important. If this center","is spoilt, or if there's something wrong with"]],[5546,["it, then you get asthma as a disease. Asthma","is only caused by this center being spoilt"]],[5556,["or some other combinations with this center.","Asthma is very common among girls and boys."]],[5563,["And the relationship with the father, or the","understanding of the father, or your own fatherhood"]],[5569,["is not all right, you get this trouble of","asthma, and for that one has to ask the questions"]],[5575,["to the sadhakas, what sort of a father you","have. As one gentleman came and asked Me,"]],[5582,["\"Why everybody's asking me, what sort of a","father you have? What sort of a - everybody"]],[5586,["asked me, what about your father, what about","your father? What has my father to do with"]],[5592,["me?\" Actually everybody feels the Right Heart,","and they have to ask about the father. Because"]],[5597,["father resides in the Right Heart, and the","principle of fatherhood, if it is spoilt,"]],[5602,["if there is a problem with the principle of","fatherhood, then you get this problem and"]],[5608,["many other problems ah which I do not want","to discuss now at length. But you can understand"]],[5614,["a person who has no father, how diffident","he is, and how he behaves, and also such people,"]],[5620,["those who have not known a father, can become","very wayward, licentious or permissive, or"]],[5626,["could be very much secretly licentious. The","people who lose their father do not have that"]],[5635,["lacking - a lacking - they lack in that discipline","that the father gives them. Or could be, such"]],[5641,["ah people could take to a very remorse and","unhappy life. Or they could be very hard on"]],[5649,["their children, or could be extremely kind","and spoil the children. It could be any way."]],[5654,["So it has of both the reactions, ah either","ah too much of love-giving or too much of"]],[5661,["strictness. It can be anything. Or a person","could be ah of this kind, may be very strict"]],[5668,["in childhood, and could be extremely lavish","in old age. It's a - it is a very imbalanced"]],[5673,["personality."]],[5673,["So the person who has no father has to know","that his father is Shri Rama. He should not"]],[5680,["worry about anything. He is the One, with","one ah arrow He can kill any number of people."]],[5687,["So he should have no fear, at all, about his","father not being there or father being dead"]],[5696,["or something happening like that. On the contrary,","if the father is dead, it's better to tell"]],[5703,["him not to worry about ah you and that you","are all right, so that you leave your father"]],[5708,["in peace and ask him to take his birth, than","to bind him to this earth."]],[5712,["This is the Right Heart and the Left Heart","is the mother, actually your own mother, whosoever"]],[5718,["it is. That is the motherhood, in the sense,","that if your mother has been extremely unkind"]],[5726,["and extremely funny, or your relationship","with mother is bad, then know that there's"]],[5733,["something wrong on the Left Heart ah which","is indicated in you."]],[5738,["So these two points are very important in","human beings. If a Sahaja Yogi just decides"]],[5745,["that, \"I have a Father and a Mother; God Almighty","is my Father and my Mother\" then these problems"]],[5752,["can be easily solved. But in Sahaja Yoga,","it is not what you think that works out, it"]],[5758,["does not. Like in the car if you sit down","and think that, \"I am going to Connaught Place\","]],[5762,["you won't move. You have to move your hands.","In the same way in Sahaja Yoga you have to"]],[5768,["move your hands. Clear you Chakras, move them","higher and put them up. It's not what you"]],[5772,["think is important in Sahaja Yoga. Not at","all. You may think ah that, \"I'm doing very"]],[5776,["well in Sahaja Yoga, I'm very good\", but it's","not so. It is what you actually achieve, your"]],[5784,["ascent is the point. So, as in the car, as","I told you, you cannot just sit down and think"]],[5790,["and do the job. In the same way, you have","to run this machine, and you have to see that"]],[5797,["you get all this movement. There should be","[SOUNDS LIKE ghati] in you. Otherwise, there"]],[5802,["is no sense in just talking about Sahaja Yoga,","thinking about Sahaja Yoga, and eh convincing"]],[5808,["yourself that you are a great Sahaja Yogi.","It is how you manifest it is the point, which"]],[5814,["very few people understand. Very, very few","people understand that it has to be manifesting,"]],[5819,["it has to be [SOUNDS LIKE karyanmit]. It is","not just talk, talk, talk, talk, talk, talk"]],[5825,["morning till evening."]],[5826,["Even when I'm talking, now I'm opening your","heart, Heart Center. I'm working it. Even"]],[5831,["I'm talking, also I'm opening. It's working.","You will see your Heart Chakra is open by"]],[5836,["the time I finish My lecture. It is so, because","I know how to do it. When I talk I'm just"]],[5843,["watching where the Chakras are catching, what's","happening and I'm catching all these points"]],[5847,["and touching it and trying to open it.","And that's how it should be, that even when"]],[5852,["you talk it should be karyanvit. Even when","you are quiet and raising hands it should"]],[5857,["be karyanvit. Whatever you do, you should","be karyanvit. Even if you glance at anyone"]],[5861,["it should be karyanvit, it should not be just","a eh kind of a jabbering that we do sometimes"]],[5869,["about Sahaja Yoga."]],[5871,["The greatest fear human beings have that they","think they have done lots of mistakes, and"]],[5879,["these mistakes are too many, and they can","never get Realization, they'll be doomed,"]],[5884,["they'll be going to hell. This is not true,","at all true. Nobody is going to go hell - if"]],[5891,["they you do not want to. If you want to stop","it, you can stop it. The time has come. You"]],[5897,["are going to be blessed and blessed for ever.","So may God bless you!"]],[5903,["Today's lecture I've given you ah in a way","that you should understand importance of confidence,"]],[5909,["but not by saying, \"I am confident.\" Because","when you say outwardly you are actually egoistical."]],[5915,["But when you say in your vibrations, then","you are confident."]],[5921,["May God bless you all!"]],[5924,["Today I'm sorry I have to go for a dinner","tonight and I won't be able to spend much"]],[5931,["time today for touching Feet, because yesterday","My brother came home for dinner and I reached"]],[5936,["11 o'clock, so he went away without eating","food. Again today he's coming so I hope today"]],[5940,["you'll excuse Me for My brother because, after","all I must look after your Mama also sometimes"]],[5948,["(Laughter). May God bless you!"]],[5958,["Tomorrow I'll talk to you about Vishuddhi","Chakra, ah which I will start exactly at 6.30."]],[5963,["I hope you make it convenient to Me and exactly","at 6.30 we start our program tomorrow exactly"]],[5968,["at 6.30."]],[5969,["(Shri Mataji speaks in Hindi a few words)"]],[5969,["Those who do not obey suffer. You should not.","Once I've said it, what is there? Obedience,"]],[5969,["why is it difficult? Why is it difficult to","obey? It is just try and obey and you'll find"]],[5969,["it, obedience gives you the real confidence","- is obedience, just obedience. Just try."]],[5969,["Just try to obey. It's very simple. And said","today no touching a Feet is all right. For"]],[5969,["Indians it is difficult, but if in English,","if I say, \"You touch My Feet\" they will not,"]],[5969,["they say, \"Who are You?\" (Shri Mataji laughs).","You laugh at them and they laugh at you. That's"]],[5972,["what it is. So today you become Englishmen."]],[5972,["Thank you very much."]]]);
